      "default": "GUMFORCE is 8x harder than regular gum. That means real resistance on your masseter muscles — the primary muscles that define your jawline. Like any muscle, they respond to consistent training with progressive resistance.\n\nEach piece also contains 500mg of creatine monohydrate. Creatine is the most researched sports supplement in existence. The European Food Safety Authority officially recognizes that creatine increases physical performance in high-intensity exercise.\n\nResults come from consistency, combined with overall fitness and low body fat for visible definition."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Accordion 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title_3",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "What's in it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body_3",
      "label": "Answer",
      "default": "Every piece contains 500mg creatine monohydrate. No fillers, no underdosing, no guessing. Unlike some creatine gummies on the market that tested for nearly zero actual creatine, what's on our label is what's in the gum.\n\nSugar-free. Dense, chunky white pieces. You'll feel the difference the second you start chewing. This is training equipment disguised as gum.\n\n100g resealable pouch. Vegan friendly."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Accordion 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title_4",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Shipping & returns"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body_4",
