      "default": "We ship worldwide. Orders are processed within 1–2 business days. Standard delivery takes 5–8 business days depending on your location. Tracking included with every order.\n\n90-day money-back guarantee. Not satisfied? Reach out and we'll make it right. We stand behind the product because we use it ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Accordion 5 (optional)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title_5",
      "label": "Title"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body_5",
      "label": "Answer"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Accordion 6 (optional)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title_6",
      "label": "Title"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body_6",
      "label": "Answer"
    },
    {
